# Focused source-local presence fact check.
# The check runs as the compile-time step of this compile, so its streams and
# exit status are the compiler process's own. Run from the repository root,
# with the output path supplied per attempt:
#   nix develop -c haxe tests/haxe/local-presence-contract/run.hxml \
#     > out/local-presence-contract/<run>/check-stdout.txt \
#     2> out/local-presence-contract/<run>/check-stderr.txt
# The exit status carries the verdict; a nonzero status is a failed check.
-cp packages/compiler
-cp tests/haxe/local-presence-contract
-main lpc.Main
--macro lpc.Checker.run()
--interp
-D local-presence-check
